    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886620/extras/ac4c426d46684eb098d15d038d2ec47f.avif?t=1754903170\" width=600 height=231 /></span><br><br>After decades of infighting between its clans, the insect kingdom seemed to have found balance. Unfortunately, shaking this delicate status quo, a new threat has appeared on the outskirts of the kingdom. Tales have reached the capital of insects being taken over by unusual fungal aberrations. Faced with a common enemy, the clans set aside their differences for now and send their best warriors to face off against this mysterious looming plague.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886620/extras/ca2b15efe8e1087cfea35ca8bc4c1ddc.avif?t=1754903170\" width=600 height=231 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886620/extras/16a2c2b50a26a371dc510e7c2f34090c.poster.avif?t=1754903170\" width=600 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886620/extras/16a2c2b50a26a371dc510e7c2f34090c.webm?t=1754903170\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886620/extras/16a2c2b50a26a371dc510e7c2f34090c.mp4?t=1754903170\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Use your strategic senses to pick the best insectoid recruits to face the fungal monstrosities! Each has their own strengths and weaknesses, and it\u2019s up to you to make good use of them!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886620/extras/d56821438721e56c954d3b3455f4047d.avif?t=1754903170\" width=600 height=231 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886620/extras/8975aa0a3871e50e5c052606d2ae0c4f.poster.avif?t=1754903170\" width=600 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886620/extras/8975aa0a3871e50e5c052606d2ae0c4f.webm?t=1754903170\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886620/extras/8975aa0a3871e50e5c052606d2ae0c4f.mp4?t=1754903170\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Face the threat head-on! Find the best placement and strategy to defeat your opponents and break through the enemy lines!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886620/extras/a319178c761b051f0731e1f6fb69a37c.avif?t=1754903170\" width=600 height=231 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886620/extras/f77dd7589583a952aaa180caed1acddc.poster.avif?t=1754903170\" width=600 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886620/extras/f77dd7589583a952aaa180caed1acddc.webm?t=1754903170\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886620/extras/f77dd7589583a952aaa180caed1acddc.mp4?t=1754903170\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Collect nectar after each confrontation\u2014it will heal your fighters and support your economy. It is the most precious resource. The vanquished often leave wares behind, so pick them up; you'll make better use of them!<br><br>You can also spend your nectar in the shop, but beware not to spend it all at once!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886620/extras/0125f2cf61da1aa02c0debce6a7e7a29.avif?t=1754903170\" width=600 height=231 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886620/extras/8530789181df232d9d940b4ed83166d5.poster.avif?t=1754903170\" width=600 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886620/extras/8530789181df232d9d940b4ed83166d5.webm?t=1754903170\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886620/extras/8530789181df232d9d940b4ed83166d5.mp4?t=1754903170\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Experiment with your team composition, figure out how your units interact, equip weapons, make use of your relics, and create efficient synergies to face the onslaught!",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886620/extras/ac4c426d46684eb098d15d038d2ec47f.avif?t=1754903170\" width=600 height=231 /></span><br><br>After decades of infighting between its clans, the insect kingdom seemed to have found balance. Unfortunately, shaking this delicate status quo, a new threat has appeared on the outskirts of the kingdom. Tales have reached the capital of insects being taken over by unusual fungal aberrations. Faced with a common enemy, the clans set aside their differences for now and send their best warriors to face off against this mysterious looming plague.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886620/extras/ca2b15efe8e1087cfea35ca8bc4c1ddc.avif?t=1754903170\" width=600 height=231 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886620/extras/16a2c2b50a26a371dc510e7c2f34090c.poster.avif?t=1754903170\" width=600 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886620/extras/16a2c2b50a26a371dc510e7c2f34090c.webm?t=1754903170\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886620/extras/16a2c2b50a26a371dc510e7c2f34090c.mp4?t=1754903170\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Use your strategic senses to pick the best insectoid recruits to face the fungal monstrosities! Each has their own strengths and weaknesses, and it\u2019s up to you to make good use of them!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886620/extras/d56821438721e56c954d3b3455f4047d.avif?t=1754903170\" width=600 height=231 /></span><br><br><span class=\