static.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886620/extras/0125f2cf61da1aa02c0debce6a7e7a29.avif?t=1754903170\" width=600 height=231 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886620/extras/8530789181df232d9d940b4ed83166d5.poster.avif?t=1754903170\" width=600 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886620/extras/8530789181df232d9d940b4ed83166d5.webm?t=1754903170\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2886620/extras/8530789181df232d9d940b4ed83166d5.mp4?t=1754903170\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Experiment with your team composition, figure out how your units interact, equip weapons, make use of your relics, and create efficient synergies to face the onslaught!",
